#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:38
msgid "Differences from GPU Implementation"
msgstr "与GPU实现的差异"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:40
msgid ""
"The `flash_attn_with_kvcache` interface on NPU is semantically consistent "
"with the GPU FA3 version in terms of API parameters. The key differences "
"are:"
msgstr "NPU上的`flash_attn_with_kvcache`接口在API参数方面与GPU FA3版本语义一致。主要差异如下："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:42
msgid ""
"**Unsupported features on NPU FA3**: Sliding window attention, RoPE, ALiBi, "
"Softcapping, and FP8 quantization are not yet supported."
msgstr "**NPU FA3不支持的特性**：滑动窗口注意力、RoPE、ALiBi、Softcapping和FP8量化暂不支持。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:43
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Graph capture**: The tiling of `flash_attn_with_kvcache` is processed on "
"the host side and is currently being optimized. It does not support ACL "
"graph capture (i.e., cannot be captured into a computational graph for "
"acceleration). Please use `compilation_config={\"cudagraph_mode\": "
"\"PIECEWISE\"}` when enabling FA3."
msgstr ""
"**图捕获**：`flash_attn_with_kvcache`的tiling在主机侧处理，目前正在优化中。不支持ACL图捕获（即无法捕获到计算图中进行加速）。启用FA3时请使用`compilation_config={\"cudagraph_mode\":"
" \"PIECEWISE\"}`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:45
msgid "Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "硬件要求"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:47
msgid ""
"FA3 currently requires Ascend Atlas A2 and A3 inference NPUs. We will "
"support other NPUs in the future."
msgstr "FA3 目前需要昇腾 Atlas A2 和 A3 推理 NPU。未来我们将支持其他 NPU。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:50
msgid "Software Requirements"
msgstr "软件要求"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:52
msgid ""
"FA3 requires the `flash_attn_npu` package, which provides the "
"`flash_attn_npu_v3` module with the `flash_attn_with_kvcache` operator."
msgstr ""
"FA3需要`flash_attn_npu`包，该包提供包含`flash_attn_with_kvcache`算子的`flash_attn_npu_v3`模块。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:54
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:56
msgid ""
"To install the `flash_attn_npu` wheel package, refer to: "
"<https://github.com/MinghuasLab/flash-attention-"
"npu/blob/main/README.md#installation>."
msgstr ""
"要安装 `flash_attn_npu` wheel 包，请参阅：<https://github.com/MinghuasLab/flash-"
"attention-npu/blob/main/README.md#installation>。"

