#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:134
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:136
msgid ""
"**Package not yet open-sourced**: The `flash_attn_npu` package required for "
"FA3 has not yet been released. External users cannot use FA3 until the "
"package is available."
msgstr "**包尚未开源**：FA3所需的`flash_attn_npu`包尚未发布。在包可用之前，外部用户无法使用FA3。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:137
msgid ""
"**Sliding window not supported**: FA3 does not support sliding window "
"attention. Models that require sliding window need to use the default FIA "
"backend."
msgstr "**不支持滑动窗口**：FA3不支持滑动窗口注意力。需要滑动窗口的模型需使用默认的FIA后端。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:138
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**ACL graph capture not supported**: The tiling of `flash_attn_with_kvcache`"
" is processed on the host side and currently does not support ACL graph "
"capture. Please use `compilation_config={\"cudagraph_mode\": \"PIECEWISE\"}`"
" when enabling FA3."
msgstr ""
"**不支持ACL图捕获**：`flash_attn_with_kvcache`的tiling在主机侧处理，目前不支持ACL图捕获。启用FA3时请使用`compilation_config={\"cudagraph_mode\":"
" \"PIECEWISE\"}`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:139
msgid ""
"**RoPE not supported**: FA3 does not support rotary position embedding "
"within the attention kernel. vLLM-Ascend patches this by using the PyTorch "
"native RoPE fallback instead."
msgstr "**不支持RoPE**：FA3不支持注意力内核内的旋转位置编码。vLLM-Ascend通过使用PyTorch原生RoPE回退来修补此问题。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:140
msgid ""
"**ALiBi not supported**: FA3 does not support ALiBi (Attention with Linear "
"Biases)."
msgstr "**不支持ALiBi**：FA3不支持ALiBi（线性偏置注意力）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:141
msgid ""
"**Softcapping not supported**: FA3 does not support attention logit "
"softcapping."
msgstr "**不支持Softcapping**：FA3不支持注意力logit softcapping。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:142
msgid ""
"**FP8 quantization not supported**: FA3 does not support FP8 quantized "
"attention."
msgstr "**不支持FP8量化**：FA3不支持FP8量化注意力。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:143
msgid ""
"**MLA and SFA not supported**: FA3 does not support Multi-head Latent "
"Attention (MLA) or Sparse Flash Attention (SFA)."
msgstr "**不支持MLA和SFA**：FA3不支持多头潜在注意力（MLA）或稀疏Flash注意力（SFA）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/flash_attention.md:146
msgid ""
"Enabling FA3 may cause performance degradation compared to the default FIA "
"backend. This trade-off is intentional to guarantee training-inference "
"consistency."
msgstr "启用FA3可能导致性能相比默认的FIA后端有所下降。这种权衡是有意为之，旨在保证训练与推理的一致性。"

